            "value" : "Maghrib"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maghrib se récitait avec le **Mufassal court** : **At-Tin (95)**, **Ad-Dhariyat (51)**, **At-Tur (52)**, **Al-Mursalat (77)** sont rapportées. Parfois plus court (At-Tin), parfois plus long (At-Tur)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "كانت المغرب تُقرأ فيها سور من **قصار المفصل**: وردت **التين (٩٥)** و**الذاريات (٥١)** و**الطور (٥٢)** و**المرسلات (٧٧)**. أحيانًا أقصر (التين)، وأحيانًا أطول (الطور)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maghrib was recited with the **short Mufassal**: **At-Tin (95)**, **Ad-Dhariyat (51)**, **At-Tur (52)** and **Al-Mursalat (77)** are reported. Sometimes shorter (At-Tin), sometimes longer (At-Tur)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
